&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: center"&gt;109,600&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: center"&gt;[109,600]&lt;/p&gt;
